---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';

/** The cookie policy in English (`/en/cookies`). */
---

<Legal title="Cookie policy">
  <p>
    This website <strong>uses no cookies</strong> or other ways of storing data in your browser: no
    analytics, advertising or social network cookies. That is why we do not ask you to accept them.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nor does it include maps, videos or social network buttons that could set third-party cookies.
    Links to maps, social networks or WhatsApp open those services on their own website, which has
    its own cookie policy.
  </p>
  {site.analytics ? (
    <p>
      To know how many people visit the website we use a statistics tool that uses no cookies, keeps
      no data that identifies you and respects your browser's "Do Not Track" setting.
    </p>
  ) : null}
  <p>If we ever start using cookies, we will say so here and ask for your permission first.</p>
</Legal>
